{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Messticulous</strong>, <strong>aim and</strong> <strong>throw objects to unusual spots</strong> following a completely wacky 'tidy up' system, all with <strong>physics-based gameplay</strong> that reminds mini-golf games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accomplish wacky tidying challenges in the least practical way </strong>that will push the limits of your ingenuity and precision, so that, in the end, everything still looks pretty messy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meticulously prepare your throws, find the right trajectories, exploit bounces and avoid obstacles to send each object where it &quot;belongs&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301880/extras/72b1dbabc92164505fe6aa8e9c4dc158.poster.avif?t=1775074063\" width=720 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301880/extras/72b1dbabc92164505fe6aa8e9c4dc158.webm?t=1775074063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301880/extras/72b1dbabc92164505fe6aa8e9c4dc158.mp4?t=1775074063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301880/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1775074063\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301880/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1775074063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301880/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1775074063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unusual way of tidying up that's 100% original!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic, zany gameplay based entirely on physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of challenging trick shots to complete in 19 rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+90 minutes of playtime</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, for the last time, yes, this is where it goes. I have my own system... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, the slipper goes in the bowl. Why do you ask?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A word from the development team </strong>(even though there's only one person):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hi, I'm Ludovic, the game developer. I just wanted to tell you that I created Messticulous because I really like offbeat games and physics-based challenges! I hope you're going to have a great time throwing all these objects to wacky places to 'tidy up'!</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"5e0a4fc040b15956b3f5e66720d4a02ea3419e35.jpg","localized_name":"Room 1","name":"Room 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301880/5e0a4fc040b15956b3f5e66720d4a02ea3419e35.jpg"},{"icon":"dab830fae2a98a737d8a6a7436279aec2a30e95a.jpg","localized_name":"Room 2","name":"Room 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301880/dab830fae2a98a737d8a6a7436279aec2a30e95a.jpg"},{"icon":"b0ad4ca1f7c5757575ce18eeefa2ffc0b1de8951.jpg","localized_name":"Room 3","name":"Room 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301880/b0ad4ca1f7c5757575ce18eeefa2ffc0b1de8951.jpg"},{"icon":"4829c62844fd2c5baca3f29709127b3419d63a34.jpg","localized_name":"Room 4","name":"Room 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301880/4829c62844fd2c5baca3f29709127b3419d63a34.jpg"},{"icon":"6c37dd85a21302f4a9d124626f4c33717f60e7fa.jpg","localized_name":"Room 5","name":"Room 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301880/6c37dd85a21302f4a9d124626f4c33717f60e7fa.jpg"},{"icon":"dc61dca41470dd3f24dd2608ab76994eff02e369.jpg","localized_name":"Room 6","name":"Room 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301880/dc61dca41470dd3f24dd2608ab76994eff02e369.jpg"},{"icon":"d325bb05bad83d415184f81d22bc1fba77c1c98e.jpg","localized_name":"Room 7","name":"Room 7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301880/d325bb05bad83d415184f81d22bc1fba77c1c98e.jpg"},{"icon":"bb84e9980fa6ff19161949b8cfb5a0385bb39a3b.jpg","localized_name":"Room 8","name":"Room 8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301880/bb84e9980fa6ff19161949b8cfb5a0385bb39a3b.jpg"},{"icon":"06e79934ee457b8b78d98498be70134e440cf787.jpg","localized_name":"Room 9","name":"Room 9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301880/06e79934ee457b8b78d98498be70134e440cf787.jpg"},{"icon":"85c5787dbc364c00f6a17d5885b22fcb3796d585.jpg","localized_name":"Room 10","name":"Room 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301880/85c5787dbc364c00f6a17d5885b22fcb3796d585.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1301880?t=1775074063","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1775074063","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301880/42eab04a17d082b8867e165dcdfa8af8e9db5101